<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-8">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Performance Benchmark Results</h1>
  
  <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg p-6 mb-6">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4">Query Performance Comparison</h2>
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <div class="bg-red-50 rounded-lg p-4">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-red-800 mb-2">Old Implementation</h3>
        <p class="text-3xl font-bold text-red-600"><%= @old_time %> ms</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-red-700">Multiple queries with N+1 problems</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="bg-green-50 rounded-lg p-4">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-green-800 mb-2">New Optimized Implementation</h3>
        <p class="text-3xl font-bold text-green-600"><%= @new_time %> ms</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-green-700">Bulk queries with optimized selects</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="mt-6 bg-blue-50 rounded-lg p-4">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm text-blue-700">Performance Improvement</p>
          <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-blue-800"><%= @improvement %>%</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm text-blue-700">Speed Multiplier</p>
          <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-blue-800"><%= @speedup %>x faster</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  
  <div class="bg-gray-100 rounded-lg p-6">
    <h3 class="font-semibold mb-3">Optimizations Applied:</h3>
    <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-gray-700">
      <li>Combined country + federal states query using JOIN (2 queries → 1 query)</li>
      <li>Bulk bridge days check instead of individual queries (48 queries → 1 query)</li>
      <li>Optimized SELECT to only fetch required fields</li>
      <li>Removed unnecessary :periods preload on federal states</li>
      <li>Used indexed lookups with Map instead of repeated filters</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>